    },
    "title": "Recipe Scaler with a Judge",
    "author": {
      "id": "u_ca895b4e5559",
      "displayName": "Avery Quinn"
    },
    "createdAt": "2026-10-23T16:00:00Z",
    "body": "My workflow scales a recipe to a new serving size. A second model scores each draft out of 10 and 8 passes. Below that, one revision runs with the judge's notes, at most twice, then it goes to me.\n\nTo test the failure path I raised the bar to 10 for one run.\n\nQuestion for the class: how do you keep a judge from being too generous?",
    "sourceUrl": "https://yellowdig.app/n/carey-school-of-business/community/6acd2896-76e7-400f-9a00-cfd657470859?postId=syn-w2-p01",
    "comments": [
      {
        "commentId": "syn-w2-p01-c1",
        "parentId": "syn-w2-p01",
        "author": {
          "id": "u_81dac53ff9c9",
          "displayName": "Blake Torres"
        },
        "createdAt": "2026-10-23T16:40:00Z",
        "body": "Did you add a hard check on units? Judges miss those."
      },
      {
        "commentId": "syn-w2-p01-c2",
        "parentId": "syn-w2-p01",
        "author": {
          "id": "u_82686b643d8b",
          "displayName": "Jordan Ellis"
        },
        "createdAt": "2026-10-23T17:35:00Z",
        "body": "Raising the threshold to test the failure path is clever."
      },
      {
        "commentId": "syn-w2-p01-c3",
        "parentId": "syn-w2-p01",
        "author": {
          "id": "u_ca895b4e5559",
          "displayName": "Avery Quinn"
        },
        "createdAt": "2026-10-23T18:10:00Z",
        "body": "Yes, a code node now rejects any ingredient without a unit."
      }
    ],
